---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 日常
roomPage: balcony
permalink: /daily/
---
{%- set key = "balcony" %}{% include "room-head.njk" %}
{%- set list = collections.daily | reverse %}
<section class="block">
  {%- if list.length %}
  <ul class="cards">{% for post in list %}{% include "card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</ul>
  {%- else %}
  <div class="empty-room">
    <p class="empty-big">陽台的花剛種下。</p>
    <p>在 GitHub 的 <code>daily</code> 資料夾新增一篇 .md，就會出現在這裡。</p>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</section>
